 "summary": "The chart-wise translation from `C^\u03c9` to `AnalyticAt` on manifolds, the analytic coordinate changes and the manifold identity theorem don't exist in Mathlib (no `AnalyticAt`/`AnalyticOnNhd` hits under `Mathlib/Geometry/Manifold`) or in TauCeti, and the proofs reuse the relevant Mathlib lemmas (`contDiffOn_extendCoordChange`, `contDiffOn_omega_iff_analyticOn`, `contMDiffWithinAt_iff_source_of_mem_maximalAtlas`, `AnalyticOnNhd.eqOn_of_preconnected_of_eventuallyEq`). The preferred-chart variants mirror Mathlib's own `contDiffOn_ext_coord_change` pattern.",
